flowchart LR
  Citizen([Citizen]) --> Auth((Register / sign in))
  Citizen --> Submit((Submit complaint))
  Citizen --> Own((View own complaints))
  Submit -. optional image .-> AI((AI image classification))
  Admin([Administrator]) --> Auth
  Admin --> Review((Review all complaints))
  Admin --> Accounts((Manage department accounts))
  Admin --> Assign((Assign complaint))
  Admin --> Update((Set status / priority))
  Admin --> Counts((View dashboard counts))
  Dept([Department user]) --> Auth
  Dept --> Assigned((View assigned complaints))
  Dept --> Accept((Accept assignment))
  Dept --> Progress((Post progress / complete work))
